ath":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-2w.1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-2w.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"b4d5ff1593889bc6695b2caa45a15fbaf4b0a7651a57adde608200bbfac0136b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-2w.1/meta.json","size_bytes":5450},"prompt":{"digest":"f36d9a1e8ea3b9f4ffa91f002605acd552ecb71d8a903eaab7eb128062ac1c95","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-2w.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":183},"state":{"digest":"31d5427c3507448ad6e9f35240d8d3fb0679c520d61f8c3a0402f900e616bfc0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-2w.1/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-2w.1","local_name":"bob-cli-2w.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-2w","agent_clan_generation":"20260930134415","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-2w.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-2w[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Cancel tasks with an optional reason from the Ctrl+Shift+P picker[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]In Obsidian, Ctrl+Shift+P on a #task line (bare or counted) or on a[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]dedicated Task Link offers a pinned Cancel row. It asks for an [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]optional reason, then closes the task(s) as Cancelled `[-]` with a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`\\[cancelled:: YYYY-MM-DD]` stamp and records the reason under a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]managed `❌ **CANCEL LOG**` child. It also removes the tasks' links[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]from today's open Pomodoros, unblocks their dependents right away, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]and confirms with a rich notice card.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]cancel_task_picker.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/cancel_task_picker.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-2w[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-2w/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task Status Cycler: versioned dependent-recovery API and [/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]cancelled-link guard[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]tsc-recovery-api[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tsc-recovery-api: expose `api.recoverBlockedDependents` (version 1) from[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task-status-cycler. Keep a dependent Blocked while it has a strictly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]future `scheduled` date. When Ctrl+Enter lands on a Task Link to a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Cancelled task, show a notice instead of completing the owning Pomodoro.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Bump the version, update the README, add tests, and sync to the vault.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation Hotkeys: Cancel Log grammar and pure cancel planner[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cancel-planner[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cancel-planner: add the `❌ **CANCEL LOG**` marker/entry grammar, a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`cancel` managed-log kind (so project conversion carries the log), and a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pure batch planner. The planner sets `[-]`, upserts `\\[cancelled::]`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]writes the Cancel Log first-child/prepend/fallback entry, refuses [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recurring tasks, and returns the cancelled identities. Export the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]helpers and unit-test them. No UI yet.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Navigation Hotkeys: Cancel row, reason stage, guarded writes, [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]and notice card[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cancel-picker[dim] · [dim][/dim]after tsc-recovery-api, cancel-planner[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cancel-picker: wire the pinned Cancel row and the live-preview reason [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stage into BulletPropertyPickerModal for single, counted, and Task Link [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sessions. Commit through the existing guarded editor and cross-note [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]write paths, including the today's-Pomodoro prune. Call the TSC recovery[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]API, show the Cancelled notice card, add CSS, bump the version, update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the README, add tests, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli documentation for the cancel gesture and the Cancel [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]Log[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cancel-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cancel-picker[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cancel-docs: document the gesture, the written shape, and its side [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]effects in docs/projects.md. Add a Cancel Log row to the README glossary[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and update docs/task-status-hooks.md for immediate cancel pruning, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recovery API, and both new guards. Add a parity comment in bob-cli's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]managed-log parser and propose a glossary follow-up.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-2w","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-2w.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"s